{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bark and Catch</strong> \u2013 A fast-paced game for 1-4 players where you take on the role of dogs and must complete important farm tasks within a time limit: grow and prepare food, feed the animals, and deliver farm products to their destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/extras/a51478a90fe6cbd2870467b4fd0075d5.poster.avif?t=1760638469\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/extras/a51478a90fe6cbd2870467b4fd0075d5.webm?t=1760638469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/extras/a51478a90fe6cbd2870467b4fd0075d5.mp4?t=1760638469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Teamwork</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your friends via local multiplayer on one PC or Steam Remote Play Together. You can divide tasks to maximize efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/extras/ec299b314481be3666bf1630c9591408.poster.avif?t=1760638469\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/extras/ec299b314481be3666bf1630c9591408.webm?t=1760638469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/extras/ec299b314481be3666bf1630c9591408.mp4?t=1760638469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep the Farm Safe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wolves, foxes, wild boars, and other predators will try to cause chaos on the farm\u2014scaring livestock, stealing, and eating crops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your additional task is to fend them off by any means necessary: barking, defensive towers, and other structures.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/extras/b16923458a3614fcf8641cfdece92fd0.poster.avif?t=1760638469\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/extras/b16923458a3614fcf8641cfdece92fd0.webm?t=1760638469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/extras/b16923458a3614fcf8641cfdece92fd0.mp4?t=1760638469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3353090?t=1760638469","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3353090?t=1760638469","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/bda34982b94a1d7614dadae17588b0565b80e774/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760638469","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/bda34982b94a1d7614dadae17588b0565b80e774/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760638469","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3498920,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bark and Catch</strong> \u2013 A fast-paced game for 1-4 players where y